@HostAddress = http://localhost:5169

### 1. List All Permission Groups (With Constituent Permissions Catalog)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/permission-groups
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Create a Dynamic System Role (e.g. Senior Cashier)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/roles
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "roleName": "senior-cashier",
  "description": "Senior cashier with POS register and daily closing privileges."
}

###

### 3. List Dynamic Roles (Paginated with Search & Filters)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/roles?page=1&pageSize=10&search=cashier&isActive=true
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Get Role Details By ID (Replace with created role GUID)
@RoleId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/roles/{{RoleId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Synchronize Assigned Permission Groups (Full Sync - ADR-004 & ADR-005)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/roles/{{RoleId}}/permission-groups
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "permissionGroupIds": [
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"
  ]
}

###

### 6. Edge Case: Revoke All Permissions (Empty Array - Vacuous Truth Semantics)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/roles/{{RoleId}}/permission-groups
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "permissionGroupIds": []
}

###

### 7. Edge Case: Validation Failure (Empty Role Name - RFC 7807 ProblemDetails)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/v1/roles
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "roleName": "",
  "description": ""
}

###
